@page
@model iD_Develops.Pages.LanguageAndCommunication.Communication.IndexModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Communication";
}

<section class="public-page">
    <div class="public-container public-content-narrow">
        <p class="public-eyebrow public-eyebrow-left">Language &amp; Communication</p>
        <h1 class="public-page-title">Communication</h1>
        <p class="public-copy">
        No matter what a smooth talker you are, sometimes it’s difficult to choose the right words or to attune adequatly to your audience or communicational partner. 
        Communication is about a lot more than talking or sending out an e-mail. Cultural differences, negotiations, convincing clients, 
        employees or relations of much needed changes, getting everyone in the same direction, and so on. 
        And all this preferably in an enjoyable way and without hurting anyone’s feelings. 
        Oral or verbal; we’ll help you find the right way or provide you with the right tools. 
        </p>
    </div>
</section>
